    "body": "I understand that the ECMAScript value is the ting that can be Callable, and it seems that at least the union resolution will convert a Callable ECMAScript value to a callable type. Otherwise, it will convert it to a dictionary-like type?\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean about a full stop separating things though.",
